# Cmdr. Troi, Outgoing Empath: "Vigilance / {T}: Target opponent whose turn it is may cast a spell from their hand without
# paying its mana cost. If they do, you copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy. If they don't, you draw a
# card." Lightning Greaves gives Troi haste on turn 1, so its {T} ability can be activated on Bot2's turn, and its only legal
# target is the opponent whose turn it is. Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt for nothing (CR 608.2g, 118.9) at Bot1; Bot1 copies that
# spell and sends the copy at Bot2 (CR 707.10, 707.10c), so both players take 3 and Bot2's Bolt cost it nothing.

